Metric:
- id: workflow.sla_adherence
- name: 
- description: This metric quantifies the extent to which workflows within an ERP, HR, or ITSM system comply with predefined Service Level Agreements (SLAs). It tracks the timely completion of tasks and processes, ensuring that they are executed within the stipulated timeframes. By measuring SLA adherence, organizations can identify bottlenecks and inefficiencies that lead to delays or violations. This metric serves as a critical indicator of operational performance and service quality, enabling teams to take corrective actions when necessary. Additionally, it helps in maintaining accountability and transparency in service delivery across various departments.

