Metric:
- id: q2c.throughput
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the efficiency and speed of the quote-to-cash (Q2C) process, which encompasses all activities from generating a sales quote to receiving payment for goods or services. It measures the time taken to convert a customer inquiry into a finalized sale and subsequent revenue recognition. By analyzing throughput, organizations can identify bottlenecks in order processing, invoicing, and payment collection, thereby enhancing operational efficiency. The scope includes all relevant workflows, controls, and automation tools that facilitate the seamless transition from order placement to cash receipt. Ultimately, this metric provides insights into the effectiveness of sales and finance collaboration, impacting overall business performance.

