- description: This metric assesses the overall health and connectivity of the integration topology within an enterprise system. It measures the status of various integration nodes, which are critical points where different systems or applications connect and exchange data. By identifying weak or failing nodes, this metric helps organizations understand potential bottlenecks or points of failure in their workflows. The scope includes all integration points across ERP, HR, and ITSM systems, ensuring that data flows seamlessly between them. A healthy integration topology is essential for maintaining operational efficiency and data integrity across the enterprise.

