Metric:
- id: ai.penetration
- name: 
- description: This metric quantifies the extent to which artificial intelligence (AI) technologies are integrated into various enterprise workflows, including ERP, HR, and ITSM processes. It measures both the depth of AI utilization within specific functions—such as automated decision-making, predictive analytics, and intelligent process automation—and the breadth of coverage across different departments and operational areas. By assessing AI penetration, organizations can identify which workflows have successfully adopted AI solutions and which areas may require further investment or development. This metric serves as a critical indicator of an organization's digital transformation journey and its commitment to leveraging AI for enhanced efficiency and effectiveness. Ultimately, it provides insights into the overall maturity of AI integration within the enterprise.

